  </section>

  <section id="rooms">
    <h2>Room types, sizes and beds</h2>
    <p>Art of Animation is really two products in one resort. The Little Mermaid section has standard Value rooms. The Cars, Finding Nemo and Lion King sections are family suites. Disney also sells a "Family Suites" category where the theme is assigned at check-in, usually at a slightly lower price than picking Finding Nemo yourself.</p>
