  <section id="transport">
    <h2>Getting to the parks</h2>
    <p>Art of Animation has two free options: the Disney Skyliner gondola and Disney buses. The bus stop is outside Animation Hall. The Skyliner station sits on the Generation Gap Bridge and is shared with Pop Century.</p>
