  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Landscape of Flavors</strong> is the food court in Animation Hall. It serves breakfast, lunch and dinner. Disney's dining page listed hours of 7:00 a.m. to 11:00 p.m. when we checked <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span>.</li>
      <li><strong>The Drop Off Pool Bar</strong> at the Big Blue Pool serves drinks and snacks.</li>
      <li><strong>Everything POP</strong> at Pop Century is a short walk across the Generation Gap Bridge if you want a second food court.</li>
      <li>You can use mobile ordering in the My Disney Experience app.</li>
      <li><strong>Park dining reservations:</strong> Disney resort guests can book their whole stay (up to 10 nights) starting 60 days before arrival.</li>
    </ul>
    <span class="ryan">[Ryan: your go-to order at Landscape of Flavors, and one thing you'd skip.]</span>
