  <section id="booking">
    <h2>Booking and value tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Book a Little Mermaid room if you only need space for four.</strong> In 2026 those rooms ran from $251 to $443 a night at full price including tax, depending on dates. That's the lowest rate at this resort.</li>
      <li><strong>If you need a suite, compare the "theme assigned at check-in" rate with a named section.</strong> Finding Nemo suites usually cost the most, because they're closest to the lobby and the main pool. In 2026, family suites ran about $519 to $992 a night at full price including tax.</li>
      <li><strong>Extra adults cost more.</strong> Rates assume two adults. Each extra adult adds $15 a night plus tax, and kids under 18 are free.</li>
      <li><strong>Check Disney's own offers page first.</strong> Disney points to <a href="https://disneyworld.disney.go.com/special-offers/">its special offers page</a> for discounts. Our deals hub will track current ones.</li>
      <li><strong>Avoid Jan 24–30, 2027</strong> if the Skyliner is why you're picking Art of Animation.</li>
      <li><strong>Lightning Lane head start:</strong> Disney resort guests can buy Lightning Lane passes up to 7 days before their stay.</li>
    </ul>
